   License: BSD-2-Clause, Copyright (c) 2026, 'sambitcoin'
   (full text: bitcoinmonetaryview/rules/upstream/LICENSE)

   Files copied verbatim (byte-identical, verified by tests):
     bitcoinmonetaryview/rules/upstream/monetary_store.py   (tools/monetary_store.py)
     bitcoinmonetaryview/rules/upstream/carrier_policy.py   (tools/carrier_policy.py)
     tests/upstream/test_monetary_store.py                  (tools/test_monetary_store.py)

   bitcoinmonetaryview/rules/monetary_rules.py applies these rules to a block and
   mirrors upstream's strip_block() step by step (parity-tested). Documented
   extensions, both parameters that leave the rule logic unchanged:
     - the P2TR dust start height is a parameter (upstream hard-codes mainnet
       height 767,430) so test networks can be analysed;
     - upstream's carrier_policy.Policy is wired in as described in upstream's
       tools/CARRIER_POLICY.md ("Integration"), as an option (default on).
       With it off, results equal upstream's published ruleset.

